## 8. Application Insights

### What is Application Insights?

**Application Insights** is an application performance monitoring (APM) service.

**Key Features**:
- Performance monitoring
- Error tracking
- Custom metrics
- Distributed tracing
- Real-time dashboards

### MaritimeIQ Application Insights Configuration

```json
{
  "type": "Microsoft.Insights/components",
  "apiVersion": "2020-02-02",
  "name": "maritime-insights",
  "properties": {
    "Application_Type": "web",
    "RetentionInDays": 90
  }
}
```

### Using Application Insights

```csharp
// Track custom metrics
_telemetryClient.TrackMetric("maritime.vessel.position.updates", count);

// Track custom events
_telemetryClient.TrackEvent("VesselDeparture", new Dictionary<string, string>
{
    { "vesselName", vessel.Name },
    { "departurePort", departurePort }
});

// Track dependencies
_telemetryClient.TrackDependency("SQL", "GetVessels", startTime, duration, true);
```

