## 10. Deployment Automation

### Deployment Script

```bash
#!/bin/bash
# deploy-full-platform.sh

set -e

echo "🚀 Deploying MaritimeIQ Platform to Azure"

# 1. Create resource group
az group create --name maritime-rg --location eastus

# 2. Deploy infrastructure
az deployment group create \
  --resource-group maritime-rg \
  --template-file azure-infrastructure.json \
  --parameters appName=maritime-platform uniqueId=001

# 3. Deploy container app
az containerapp create \
  --name maritime-api \
  --resource-group maritime-rg \
  --environment maritime-env \
  --image maritimecr.azurecr.io/maritime-api:latest

# 4. Deploy functions
func azure functionapp publish maritime-functions

echo "✅ Deployment completed!"
```

